==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ren Katagiri (Enemy)|Ren Katagiri]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Zombies are here to slowly allow Ren to advance towards your base. Luckily, the boss is outranged by almost everything, so take advantage of that! Build up attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] on the Zombies and chip away at Ren's HP. The Zombies will continuously attempt to separate your forces, so just deal with them quickly as they unburrow.

